{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"happened to it, and other parts need to respond right away: a barrel is hit, a button is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"clicked. Declare the event as a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", register observers with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:on:perform:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:perform:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and trigger it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trigger(_:on:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". The observers run before ","type":"text"},{"code":"trigger(_:on:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example despawns a barrel when it explodes:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct Explode: EntityEvent { var radius: Double }","","var world = World()","let barrel = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Barrel\"))","world.observe(Explode.self, on: barrel) { world, trigger in","    world.despawn(trigger.entity)","}","","world.trigger(Explode(radius: 3), on: barrel)","print(world.contains(barrel))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An entity event differs from an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which waits in a queue until systems read it.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Propagating-Up-the-Hierarchy","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Propagating Up the Hierarchy"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An event whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\